    "axis": "accessibility",
    "evidence": "Composer passes automated WCAG checks at all three viewports: zero violations/incomplete results, all 10 controls are keyboard-reachable with visible focus, no touch-target failures, no viewport overflow, and reduced-motion sampling found no element movement. However, the actual header has unresolved serious color-contrast checks: 12 navigation links on mobile and one on tablet. Its horizontally clipped navigation also lacks supplied evidence of an accessible scroll affordance. Required contrast proof is therefore incomplete.",
